+* FEATURE: [vmagent](https://docs.victoriametrics.com/victoriametrics/vmagent/): add service discovery support for [Scaleway](https://www.scaleway.com/en/) Instances. See [these docs](https://docs.victoriametrics.com/victoriametrics/sd_configs/#scaleway_sd_configs).
